==FC Lahti Akatemia==
{{Main|FC Lahti Akatemia}}

Lahti's reserve team played its last season in [[Kakkonen]] in 2017. After they were relegated to [[Kolmonen]] for the 2018 season, the team's activity was taken over by its administrational parent club [[FC Kuusysi|Kuusysi]].

